# Upload set for the ROOT Vercel project ("causent" = the Next.js app only).
# The Python causal services deploy as standalone projects via the scripts in
# scripts/deploy-{engine,resolve,recompute}.sh. Bundling them inside the app
# project sweeps the remote build's node_modules/.next into each Python function
# bundle (>225MB cap), while the stateful workers also need separately scoped DB
# credentials. Therefore api/ + engine/ are excluded from the root upload. The
# root requirements.txt is local/engine tooling and is excluded as well.
# NOTE: patterns are gitignore-style — root-anchored with a leading slash.
# A bare `api` also matches app/api and silently strips every Next.js API
# route (webhooks + crons 404'd in prod until 2026-07-16 because of this).
.next
/api
/engine
requirements.txt
**/__pycache__
supabase
docs
.claude
